// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SpliceTask 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1434585200" "Favor for Splice"
// DetailString :
"P631780828" "You receive a coded message from Ricochet after planting the last bomb...<br><br>'Slammer! You got 'em blowie-blows all seeded! We got ourselves a major commercial break goin' on with our B-Team in the Ministory of MISInformation! They're doing a major thumbs up for our girl Splice but are totally gettin' slammed. We need ya to do some swoopin' on 'em and get the 011's that Splice is lookin' for!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArchiveDataClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3466025655" "Archive Data"
// DetailString :
"P3631965411" "You've got the data Bravo Team was sent in here for.<br><br>Looking it over, it seems that they were trying to retrieve information on...Marauder's day planner? This can't be right."

