// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3540159046" "What's the flaw popper-rinsky?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4141566607" "Hey, what's up, {HeroName}, right?<br><br>Ricochet? Yeah, she can be tough to understand sometimes. What was it that she told you, roughly?<br><br>Gah...I hate this Resistance talk sometimes, always making sure no one up top is understanding us. Look, in a nutshell, she asked you to plant some bombs over on the topside, then check in on the team we sent to infiltrate one of the buildings in Nova. See, <i>that</i> was straightfroward."

