// Dialog :
"P1990396301" "Way to snatch the cricket, sugar cane!<br><br>You really gave those golden boys a kick in the pantaloons and while they were seeing dandelions you snatched the honey and took off with the B's.<br><br>I'm gonna spit it, but only this once; you've impressed me, curly fries!<br><br>Marauder's planner? Yeah, old loner loo <color yellow>Splice</color> was all grabby about oggling over it, spoke some jibber about it bein' the king's catch or somethin' like that, you know?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
