// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P547395359" "Cleaner bot! Them's the bots we're lookin' for here. Our main boy <color yellow>Rothstein</color> got himself planted deep in the badger pot, you feel?<br><br>So now we gotta make a pose and take a picture while we got ourselves a camerman, 'cept the only problem is them badgers got their vacuums ready to clean up any sorta milk we spill.<br><br><color yellow>Splice</color> got us a date to a dance with our bots, but I gotta ask ya to ditch the prom queen and go out there dancin' solo. You cool with that?"
// AcceptString :
"P2664647505" "...I'm dancing with what?"
// SendOffString :
"P4216414876" "You got this!<br><br><color orange>Ricochet points out a location on a map of Nova - a warehouse where the PPD keep Clockwork.</color><br><br>You gotta take your limo and park in the no parkin' zone, you dig?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2780693798" "Destroy the Clockwork(?)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3383651171" "You don't wanna be late to that robo-prom, slammer!"
