// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P414625612" "You've crippled the Clockwork warehouse - time to endure speaking with Ricochet to see what's up next."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P113126434" "We got this thing goin' on now, slapper!<br><br>With them robo bots out doing the punch-drunk, we got ourselves some time bought to let the funny gas spread out and make them PPD not so funny! All we gotta do now is get you, our big mean machine, up in there to spread the lovin'!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rothstein 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1884842408" "<color orange>Rothstein looks to be badly injured from the PPD and the gas in the air.</color><br><br>{HeroName}...? What're you...doin' here...?"
// Answer Text :
"P1415797077" "I'm getting you out, now get on your feet."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3283414963" "Hah...I'm not getting' outta here alive, {HeroName}.<br><br>This...this is where I die. I got nothing left to live for...<br><br>My wife's dead...my son and daughter...dead...<br><br>...and me? I'm knockin' on death's door. I just...wanna finally see them again. I'm too tired...too tired to keep fighting.<br><br>Just...let me rest."
// Answer Text :
"P3879031771" "Come on, get up! Are you just going to lay down and die?!"
// Answer Text :
"P1055238894" "(Leave Rothstein to die)"
// Page LayDown Text :
"P3415272405" "That's...the plan...I got no energy left...to keep fightin' these guys...as long as I know...this plan worked...I'm just fine...dyin' like this..."
// Answer Text :
"P563388345" "Too bad, I'm not. (Knock out Rothstein to drag him out)"
// Page KnockOut Text :
"P2995319214" "<color orange>You knock out Rothstein, allowing you to drag him out of the poisoned lab.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2716676227" "Weighs more than I thought...!"
// Page Leave Text :
"P4051892574" "<color orange>You decide to leave Rothstein to die. A few moments later, he lets out his lasts gasp of air before his body remains motionless.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3699373709" "Time to get out of here..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Ricochet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2333979048" "Yo slamapper! You did it!<br><br>We got them badgers all lookin' over their shoulders and changin' their clothes out now, they ain't gonna rest at the movies now that they know we're out in FORCE!<br><br>You see Rothstein's final swang song?"
// Answer Text :
"P569125551" "No, I actually saved Rothstein."
// Answer Text :
"P1628959280" "I did, I watched him die."
// Answer Text :
"P1005822399" "I never saw him in the first place."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3093388778" "Wha?! What's the lightbulb all for? You weren't asked to go in and swoop anyone!<br><br>Now we gotta throw him in the wagon and cart him along while he's soaking up space!<br><br>Aaargh! Makes me wanna punch some flowers!<br><br>I can't be staying red in the face at you though, slammer, 'cause you're tough, even if you got some sorta shield deal going on."
// Answer Text :
"P2692570762" "....right."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1026309819" "Oooo, that's makin' me get the brrrr's, slammer, you got the blood to make things happen!<br><br>Just gotta make sure you don't go doing the snappity-snap like Rothstein, best thing is to not get your rope anchored on to anythin' hard, that's my sayin'! 'Cause in this whole blippity-blap shindig, you can't be lugging around any heavy weight, you dig?"
// Answer Text :
"P1561010822" "I think I do."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2329866637" "Maybe that's the best channel to tune into, Rothstein got a whole thing goin' on of bein' the upstaging actor on the street, you know?<br><br>He woulda tried ta make it look like a new sun was settin' or somethin' before he went off into that wild yonder, you woulda been bored, trust me."
// Answer Text :
"P4108832580" "Maybe I would have. If I think I know what you said."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1281223842" "This is Rothstein's big grand finale, {HeroName}. We got the picture of the place where he's planted, along with all them little balloons of happy-gas. All we need now is someone to go on in there and flip that switch to cause night-night for good to all 'em badgers. That lotto winner is YOU, {HeroName}, 'cause of your affair with the whole swingin' some hole in one's with all them badgers. They ain't gonna make a fist seein' you, since you got that stamp of Powers Division.<br><br><color orange>Ricochet hands you a gas mask.</color><br><br>Ya just put this thing after gettin' the happy gas started and make sure them badgers don't try comin' back to life. Everyone's gonna say goodnight tonight!"
// AcceptString :
"P787116949" "Alright, and what about Rothstein?"
// SendOffString :
"P3948264096" "Rothstein? Rothstein flew the coop! Went nuts after the whole ball and chain got yanked and cracked, wanted this to be the swang song of his ballet.<br><br>He ain't wantin' to come back for a sequel, you got me? So you ain't gotta worry about signing any new deals with him, 'cause he is out for good."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2216482019" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: My Choice</color>"

