// SaysList :
"P1482522473" "<t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>WARNING!<t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>WARNING!<t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>POISON GAS DETECTED! PLEASE FLEE THE BUILDING. CLOCKWORK RECOVERY TEAM IS INBOUND<t=1 caption x= 0.1 y=0.2 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>WARNING!<t=1 caption x= 0.1 y=0.4 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>WARNING!<t=1 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>WARNING!<t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>ORIGINAL CLOCKWORK TEAM NOT FOUND. PLEASE STANDBY AS BACK UP TEAM IS LOCATED."
// SaysList :
"P1898541304" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>EMERGENCY CLOCKWORK TEAM HAS ARRIVED.<t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>PLEASE TAKE VERY SHALLOW BREATHS. THEY SHALL AID ANY PERSON IN DANGER. OR KILL ANY INTRUDER."
// SaysList :
"P2189560554" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We're under attack here by the PPD!<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>You might run into a few of 'em yourself up ahead!<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>These guys will attack you on sight, but you can try to get the drop on them first!"
// SaysList :
"P1577115295" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Ugh! Hey give that radio ba-!"
// SaysList :
"P1808450874" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Word on the street is that you ain't too pleased with being part of the Powers Division.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We could use more folks like you, people willin' to talk back to them guys in power. We meet up, we can - wha?! Hold on {HeroName}, it's the PPD!"

