// Dialog :
"P2979528613" "Shinetastic job! With bricks-for-brains safely tethered down here we won't have to scramble like omelets to break some eggs.<br><br>Yeah, yeah, I know, you don't know what I'm sayin'.<br><br>You and me, though, we finished our thirty, doesn't look like we're getting renewed for a pick-up season, but maybe we got ourselves some reruns huh?<br><br>Got someone else though who wants to ask you for some swoopin' and handin', that girl, <color yellow>Splice</color>. You up for a little round two on a different network?"
// RandomFameString :
"P402846341" "I heard about the PPD lab that was gassed, it was awful! Who would do such a thing?"

